      "React GraphQL",
      "GraphQL mutations"
    ],
    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Guides creation of separate .gql files for queries, mutations, and fragments.",
      "Shows when to run GraphQL type generation after operation changes.",
      "Demonstrates use of generated Apollo Client hooks in React components.",
      "Requires mutation loading, success, and error handling patterns.",
      "Explains common fetch policies, skip conditions, polling, and optimistic updates.",
      "Lists anti-patterns such as inline gql literals and missing mutation handlers."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Assumes an Apollo Client project with existing GraphQL code generation scripts.",
      "Does not validate schemas, resolvers, permissions, or server-side GraphQL security.",
